/* ---------- "Csh quickie" ---------- */
References:
Keywords:

This alias swaps the top two directories on the stack - useful for
directory hoppers like me:

alias / 'set dirstack=`dirs -l`; popd; cd $dirstack[1]; pushd $dirstack[2]'

